<title>UK: National Power yr pretax profits dip 8 pct.</title>
<headline>National Power yr pretax profits dip 8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending  March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		50.8		   vs 51.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 25.0		   vs 23.0</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-excepts    740		    vs 806</p>
<p> Pretax, post-excepts   718		    vs 806</p>
<p> Turnover		   3,535		  vs 3,948</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits after exceptionals in a range between 760 and 792 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - National Power Plc</p>
</text>
